mer may request a refund within 7 calendar days of the first payment if the software cannot be installed or activated on a compatible system and RoutineOff support has not been able to resolve the issue. Refund requests must be sent to ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com","children":"Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com"}],". Refund decisions may consider account activation, usage, service availability, and applicable consumer law. This policy does not limit any mandatory consumer rights."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Digital delivery"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Word Count Tool is a digital software product. After payment and account provisioning, customers receive access to the official installer and the tool account credentials. No physical goods are shipped."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Failed or expired subscriptions"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"If renewal fails, the service may provide a short grace period before tool access is paused. Restoring payment will reactivate the existing authorised users where possible."}]]}]]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"_footer_rrnft_83","children":["© 2026 RoutineOff · United Arab Emirates · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com","children":"Support"}]]}]]}]]
